Expected: `Error: Cannot find module '../src/collector.js'` (or similar import failure)

- [ ] **Step 4: Implement `src/collector.js`**

```js
export async function collect(target, findCandidates) {
  const seen = new Set();

  while (seen.size < target) {
    const candidates = await findCandidates();
    for (const item of candidates) {
      seen.add(item);
    }
  }

  return Array.from(seen).slice(0, target);
}
```

